      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Control rules: insufficient capacity stays queued; SLA is evaluated each window; stop / failure enters finalization.\nData rule: integer request totals and merged histogram buckets feed reports; terminal states return reserved capacity.",
      "originalText": "Control rules: insufficient capacity stays queued; SLA is evaluated each window; stop / failure enters finalization.\nData rule: integer request totals and merged histogram buckets feed reports; terminal states return reserved capacity.",
